    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/0e53152ba6d539b013247546e6d9993c.avif?t=1743757202\" /></span><br><br>Play as Barbie and Barbie as you work together with friends and family to complete challenges and quests to help the community. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/c7aea88384f12589c90b1f6d4374d53a.poster.avif?t=1743757202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/c7aea88384f12589c90b1f6d4374d53a.webm?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/c7aea88384f12589c90b1f6d4374d53a.mp4?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready for the ultimate Barbie\u2122 gaming adventure as Barbie and Barbie work together to save a beloved Malibu landmark, the Malibu Waves Community Center! The once thriving destination is nearly abandoned and on the verge of being closed. It\u2019s time to band together to restore the beloved community center to its former glory. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/5e56d33b8fd4438ed82dc7ec99180435.avif?t=1743757202\" /></span><br><br>Discover up to 6 new spaces and help restore the beloved community center. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/3bf166fd5c5faeb596d159ad60d42604.poster.avif?t=1743757202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/3bf166fd5c5faeb596d159ad60d42604.webm?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/3bf166fd5c5faeb596d159ad60d42604.mp4?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play as Barbie and Barbie as you team up with their BFFs and family to save the day! Put your own stamp on the Malibu landmark by combining talents and creativity to transform six spaces including the Animal Care Center, Campsite, Crafting Studio, and more! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/9a553e06fdd032e76e75a8b540a383f8.avif?t=1743757202\" /></span><br><br>Complete tasks in the Pet Salon, Skate Park, Tech Lab and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/236c1597667d82762ffca7add01c54f3.poster.avif?t=1743757202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/236c1597667d82762ffca7add01c54f3.webm?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/236c1597667d82762ffca7add01c54f3.mp4?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/d2049cb03dba0cc1ff1f7508619ad41e.avif?t=1743757202\" /></span><br><br>Collect community points and use them to unlock awesome outfits and items to upgrade the Malibu Waves Community Center.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/3adee9424dd5bfe049f882dd894fcdc0.poster.avif?t=1743757202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/3adee9424dd5bfe049f882dd894fcdc0.webm?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/3adee9424dd5bfe049f882dd894fcdc0.mp4?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use the power of friendship to complete fun quests and puzzles and unlock exciting minigames! You\u2019ll earn rewards to customize Barbie with new outfits and accessories, or upgrade spaces with exclusive paints, furnishings, and d\u00e9cor. It\u2019s going to take teamwork to turn around the Malibu Waves Community Center and make a difference.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/5115b617a5316cb03bab6f8040324bd4.avif?t=1743757202\" /></span><br><br>Play solo or team-up in local co-op. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/cfc770f400c3742aa3d7af4d7c793a44.poster.avif?t=1743757202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/cfc770f400c3742aa3d7af4d7c793a44.webm?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/cfc770f400c3742aa3d7af4d7c793a44.mp4?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It\u2019s a Barbie game like no other! Try new things with friends and family, like caring for pets with Barbie\u2019s sisters, making ice cream with Ken, renovating the arcade with Teresa, customizing scooters with Nikki, or performing a new song with Daisy as your DJ... and what Barbie adventure would be complete without an epic musical finale? Everyone will want to help Barbie and Barbie restore the community center and have a lot of fun along the way. <br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>PLAY AS BARBIE \u2013 </strong>Play as Barbie and Barbie as you work together with friends and family to complete challenges and quests to help the community. <br></li><li><strong>EXPLORE MALIBU \u2013 </strong>Discover up to 6 new spaces and help restore the beloved community center. <br></li><li><strong>TRY FUN ACTIVITIES \u2013</strong> Complete tasks in the Pet Salon, Skate Park, Tech Lab and more.  <br></li><li><strong>EARN REWARDS \u2013</strong> Collect community points and use them to unlock awesome outfits and items to upgrade the Malibu Waves Community Center. <br></li><li><strong>TEAM UP IN MINIGAMES \u2013</strong> Play solo or team-up in local co-op. </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/0e53152ba6d539b013247546e6d9993c.avif?t=1743757202\" /></span><br><br>Play as Barbie and Barbie as you work together with friends and family to complete challenges and quests to help the community. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/c7aea88384f12589c90b1f6d4374d53a.poster.avif?t=1743757202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/c7aea88384f12589c90b1f6d4374d53a.webm?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/c7aea88384f12589c90b1f6d4374d53a.mp4?t=1743757202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get ready for the ultimate Barbie\u2122 gaming adventure as Barbie and Barbie work together to save a beloved Malibu landmark, the Malibu Waves Community Center! The once thriving destination is nearly abandoned and on the verge of being closed. It\u2019s time to band together to restore the beloved community center to its former glory. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/5e56d33b8fd4438ed82dc7ec99180435.avif?t=1743757202\" /></span><br><br>Discover up to 6 new spaces and help restore the beloved community center. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/3bf166fd5c5faeb596d159ad60d42604.poster.avif?t=1743757202\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478330/extras/3bf166fd5c5faeb596d159ad60d42604.webm?t=1743757202\" typ